cally those associated with various tools, require careful consideration regarding their inclusion in the synced data. The structure of these files varies across tools.\n\nThe `session_index.jsonl` file generation process requires verification. An existing database stores essential session metadata.  Examining the database structure revealed the necessary fields for generating the `session_index.jsonl`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"find /home/koby/.claude -maxdepth 2 -name \"*index*\" -o -name \"*summary*\" -o -name \"*stats*\"","Cwd":"/home/koby","IsDaemon":false,"RequestedTerminalID":"","RunPersistent":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Searching for claude index files","toolSummary":"Search claude index files"}}]}
